 "caption": "Cold-pressed vs refined oil. What's the difference? 🫒\n\nRefined oil is usually extracted at high heat, often with chemical solvents, then bleached and deodorised.\n\nCold-pressed oil comes from seeds pressed slowly at low heat, with no solvents, so it keeps its natural aroma and taste.\n\nGroundnut and sesame for South Indian cooking. Mustard for North Indian tadka.\n\n👉 Cold-pressed oils from ₹90\n🛒 pureorganiczone.com\n\n#ColdPressedOil #WoodPressedOil #GroundnutOil #MustardOil #HealthyCooking #OrganicIndia #PureOrganicZone"
